  "paragraph": 12,
  "text": "Once connected, what can an MCP server actually offer your AI? The protocol boils everything down to three clean building blocks, organized by who is in control. First come tools—executable actions, or verbs, like searching Google Drive, scheduling a calendar event, or querying a database. Tools are model-controlled: the AI reads their descriptions and decides when to call them.",
